// ---- the near / far swap of a repeated kind as a dithered cross-fade (TODO 50: trees and rocks swapped to their
// lite version in one frame at the lite distance, a visible pop while walking or riding). Inside a band round that
// distance an instance is drawn by both meshes, each with a per-instance share of a screen dither (tddXf: 0 = whole,
// near f = the share it gives up, far -1 - f = the share it takes), so the two together always cover it once.
