// triangles at the plaza): a zone batch that stands low (under FAR_LOW m tall: road, fences, beds, props, flowers)
// and whose nearest point is past FAR_AWAY m fades out over half a second, and back in 8 m nearer. Tall things
// (barns, houses, rides, trees, the mountains) stay, so the skyline never changes; past 70 m a low piece is a few
// pixels high on a phone. Layered after the zone's own LOD swaps: their batches (_LOD) are left alone.
